@host = http://localhost:5161
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "P@$$w0rd"
}

### Login (run this first, the token is saved automatically)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "P@$$w0rd"
}

###
GET {{host}}/api/municipalities

###
GET {{host}}/api/municipalities/1

###
GET {{host}}/api/positions

###
GET {{host}}/api/positions/1

###
GET {{host}}/api/candidates

###
GET {{host}}/api/candidates/3

###
GET {{host}}/api/candidates/search?name=park

### Voting guide - add (needs token)
POST {{host}}/api/savedcandidates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateId": 3
}

### Voting guide - list (needs token)
GET {{host}}/api/savedcandidates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Voting guide - delete (needs token, use a savedCandidateId from the list)
DELETE {{host}}/api/savedcandidates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without a token -> should return 401
GET {{host}}/api/savedcandidates